      "recapEn": "Observed by a Doctor and her Gentlewoman, Lady Macbeth walks in her sleep carrying a candle, endlessly rubbing her hands to wash away invisible blood while reliving the murders of Duncan, Banquo, and Lady Macduff. Declaring that infected minds confess their secrets to their pillows and need a priest more than a physician, the Doctor orders that everything she might use to harm herself be removed.",
